  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reverse Trade Mission - Mid-Range and Heavy Duty Commercial Vehicle Fuel Economy Standards, through TERA International Group, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This reverse trade mission (RTM) familiarized official delegates from Chinas Ministry of Industry and Information Technology (MIIT), Ministry of Environmental Protection (MEP), China Automotive Technology and Research Center (CATARC), and China Internal Combustion Engine Industry Association (CICEIA) with U.S. practices and technologies in the area of mid-range and heavy duty commercial vehicle fuel economy and emissions standards. The RTM aimed to help Chinas government improve fuel economy in commercial vehicle operations.</narrative>
  </description>
